agraph","A simple guide to set up and sell on Amazon",[],"ltr",{"dimensions":39,"alt":42,"copyright":30,"url":43,"id":44,"edit":45},{"width":40,"height":41},300,51,"Amazon","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffb3d4840-a0c2-4852-aa12-a0258c32ba58_amazon.svg","YhYpMBIAACwA0QBl",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},0,1,"transparent",{},{"link_type":19},"page_header$685be352-9a1d-4aca-9374-66032117e119","page_header",{"variation":54,"version":26,"items":55,"primary":57,"id":80,"slice_type":81,"slice_label":30},"default-slice",[56],{},{"CardImage":58,"CardAvatar":66,"CardTitle":67,"CardText":68,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":78,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":59,"alt":62,"copyright":30,"url":63,"id":64,"edit":65},{"width":60,"height":61},1000,667,"A mother is placing the lid on a parcel box with the shipping label attached so it is ready to send. Her two children are sat on the sofa behind her reading a book.","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zc65bqstJ9-inP_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7587.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zc65bqstJ9-inP",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"none","Selling on Amazon",[69,72,75],{"type":34,"text":70,"spans":71,"direction":37},"Amazon helps you reach a huge audience, make extra money, and build a successful online store. With millions of users, it's a popular platform to sell new or pre-loved items quickly and easily. ",[],{"type":34,"text":73,"spans":74,"direction":37},"Get started selling on Amazon with our easy guide for UK sellers. We explain how to create an account, list your items, and choose the right carrier for delivery. ",[],{"type":34,"text":76,"spans":77,"direction":37},"Discover top tips on the best items to sell, how to sell on Amazon without inventory, and understand how much it costs to sell on Amazon. Read on to become a successful Amazon seller!",[],{"link_type":79},"Any","card$190bc9f4-7c73-4e91-ae59-d827179c3e89","card",{"variation":83,"version":26,"items":84,"primary":177,"id":183,"slice_type":81,"slice_label":30},"multiContentCard",[85,123,141,159],{"CardImage":86,"CardTitle":92,"CardText":93},{"dimensions":87,"alt":88,"copyright":30,"url":89,"id":90,"edit":91},{"width":60,"height":61},"A woman is sat at home at her desk smiling looking at her laptop screen","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"Create an Amazon seller account",[94,98,101,114,117,120],{"type":95,"text":96,"spans":97,"direction":37},"list-item","Login or create an Amazon account",[],{"type":95,"text":99,"spans":100,"direction":37},"Go to ‘Account & Lists’ in the menu ",[],{"type":95,"text":102,"spans":103,"direction":37},"Select ‘Your seller account. ’ This will take you to the UK Amazon Seller Central page",[104,112],{"start":105,"end":106,"type":107,"data":108},57,86,"hyperlink",{"link_type":109,"url":110,"target":111},"Web","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fsell.amazon.co.uk\u002Fsell-online","_blank",{"start":105,"end":106,"type":113},"strong",{"type":95,"text":115,"spans":116,"direction":37},"Choose between an Individual or Professional selling plan. The Individual plan is pay-as-you-go, while the Professional plan charges a monthly subscription fee.",[],{"type":95,"text":118,"spans":119,"direction":37},"Enter your personal and business information, including your bank account details for receiving payments.",[],{"type":95,"text":121,"spans":122,"direction":37},"Verify your identity by submitting the required documents, such as a passport or driver’s license.",[],{"CardImage":124,"CardTitle":130,"CardText":131},{"dimensions":125,"alt":126,"copyright":30,"url":127,"id":128,"edit":129},{"width":60,"height":61},"Customer sat at a desk in their office using a laptop with multiple parcels packaged next to them. Their hand is positioned against their head to show concentration.","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R3wJbqstJ9-SQ7_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8508.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R3wJbqstJ9-SQ7",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"Set up your Amazon store",[132,135,138],{"type":95,"text":133,"spans":134,"direction":37},"Customise your storefront by adding a logo, banner, and store description to create a brand identity.",[],{"type":95,"text":136,"spans":137,"direction":37},"Choose your product categories and upload your inventory.",[],{"type":95,"text":139,"spans":140,"direction":37},"Set your pricing, shipping options, and return policies.",[],{"CardImage":142,"CardTitle":148,"CardText":149},{"dimensions":143,"alt":144,"copyright":30,"url":145,"id":146,"edit":147},{"width":60,"height":61},"An older couple, a man and a woman, are sat on a sofa. The woman is showing the man something on the screen.","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oy35bqstJ9-cW3_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10785.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6oy35bqstJ9-cW3",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"List your items",[150,153,156],{"type":95,"text":151,"spans":152,"direction":37},"Use Amazon’s listing tools to create detailed product pages.",[],{"type":95,"text":154,"spans":155,"direction":37},"Add high-quality images and write compelling descriptions.",[],{"type":95,"text":157,"spans":158,"direction":37},"Include relevant keywords to improve your search visibility.",[],{"CardImage":160,"CardTitle":166,"CardText":167},{"dimensions":161,"alt":162,"copyright":30,"url":163,"id":164,"edit":165},{"width":60,"height":61},"A customer is standing in the doorway of their home, holding their parcels and smiling for the camera.","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XrMpbqstJ9-WdD_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4860.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6XrMpbqstJ9-WdD",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"Optimise your listings",[168,171,174],{"type":95,"text":169,"spans":170,"direction":37},"Use bullet points to highlight key features.",[],{"type":95,"text":172,"spans":173,"direction":37},"Set competitive prices by researching similar products.",[],{"type":95,"text":175,"spans":176,"direction":37},"Offer promotions and discounts to attract buyers.",[],{"CardSectionTitle":178,"CardSectionText":179},"How to start selling on Amazon",[180],{"type":34,"text":181,"spans":182,"direction":37},"Whether you’re just starting or have sold before, selling on Amazon is easy. Our step-by-step guide* will help you get started quickly and start selling your items right away using your desktop browser:",[],"card$cdd13fc5-4c23-498a-9596-4d3671d89e9e",{"variation":54,"version":26,"items":185,"primary":187,"id":209,"slice_type":81,"slice_label":30},[186],{},{"CardImage":188,"CardAvatar":66,"CardTitle":194,"CardText":195,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":208,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":189,"alt":190,"copyright":30,"url":191,"id":192,"edit":193},{"width":60,"height":61},"A female courier dressed in an Evri uniform stands in front of a blue Evri van. She is posing with a parcel in her hands.","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_05bqstJ9-iMl_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9407.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6y_05bqstJ9-iMl",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"Choose a carrier to deliver your parcels",[196,199],{"type":34,"text":197,"spans":198,"direction":37},"Select a reliable delivery provider to ensure fast and secure shipping for your customers, building trust and keeping buyers returning. With Evri, you get an outstanding service at great value, making sure your customers are happy from start to finish.",[],{"type":34,"text":200,"spans":201,"direction":37},"See what puts us among the best courier services in the UK for your business.",[202,207],{"start":203,"end":204,"type":107,"data":205},27,58,{"link_type":109,"url":206,"target":111},"how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fbest-courier-services-in-the-uk",{"start":203,"end":204,"type":113},{"link_type":79},"card$7c607924-49de-4591-9f71-2fda538cb481",{"variation":211,"version":26,"items":212,"primary":213,"id":232,"slice_type":81,"slice_label":30},"cardWithinSection",[],{"CardSectionTitle":214,"CardSectionText":215,"CardImage":219,"CardTitle":226,"CardText":227,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":231,"IsEco":21},"Selling on Amazon with Fulfilment by Merchant (FBM)",[216],{"type":34,"text":217,"spans":218,"direction":37},"Fulfilment by Merchant (FBM) is another great way to sell on Amazon, especially if you prefer handling your own logistics and shipping. We outline how you can do it effectively below. ",[],{"dimensions":220,"alt":222,"copyright":30,"url":223,"id":224,"edit":225},{"width":60,"height":221},643,"A close-up bird's eye view of a customer holding their mobile phone shows the Evri website home page on display. Lots of parcel boxes can be seen in the background.","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZyIqu68jQArT0BYb_small_business.jpg?auto=format,compress","ZyIqu68jQArT0BYb",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"What is Fulfilment by Merchant?",[228],{"type":34,"text":229,"spans":230,"direction":37},"With FBM, you can list your products on Amazon but manage storage, packing, and shipping yourself. This option gives you more control over your inventory and fulfilment processes.",[],{"link_type":79},"card$a2276b36-8009-4666-b9b7-7c278f14a201",{"variation":234,"version":26,"items":235,"primary":255,"id":258,"slice_type":259,"slice_label":30},"listNoIcon",[236,243,249],{"title":237,"content":238,"isNumbered":242},"Lower costs",[239],{"type":34,"text":240,"spans":241,"direction":37},"Avoid Amazon's FBA (Fulfilment by Amazon) fees and only pay for the services you need.",[],true,{"title":244,"content":245,"isNumbered":242},"Greater control",[246],{"type":34,"text":247,"spans":248,"direction":37},"Manage your own storage, packaging, and shipping processes to ensure quality.",[],{"title":250,"content":251,"isNumbered":242},"Flexibility",[252],{"type":34,"text":253,"spans":254,"direction":37},"Use your preferred carriers, such as Evri, for delivering parcels.",[],{"theme":256,"title":257,"description":30,"showPaddingTop":21},"standard","Benefits of FBM","list_block$99c07a21-2a91-4c02-bdec-5dba114ecf22","list_block",{"variation":54,"version":26,"items":261,"primary":262,"id":296,"slice_type":81,"slice_label":30},[],{"CardImage":263,"CardAvatar":66,"CardTitle":269,"CardText":270,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":295,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":264,"alt":265,"copyright":30,"url":266,"id":267,"edit":268},{"width":60,"height":61},"A close-up of a customer's hands as they are crouched on the floor, applying a label to their parcel. They are surrounded by lots of parcels.","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XsXpbqstJ9-Wex_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5263.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6XsXpbqstJ9-Wex",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"How to get started with FBM",[271,277,282,287,292],{"type":272,"text":273,"spans":274,"direction":37},"o-list-item","Set up your Amazon seller account - Similar to the steps for FBA, simply create and set up your seller account.",[275],{"start":46,"end":276,"type":113},34,{"type":272,"text":278,"spans":279,"direction":37},"Create product listings - List your products with detailed descriptions and high-quality images.",[280],{"start":46,"end":281,"type":113},23,{"type":272,"text":283,"spans":284,"direction":37},"Manage your inventory - Keep track of your stock levels and restock as needed.",[285],{"start":46,"end":286,"type":113},21,{"type":272,"text":288,"spans":289,"direction":37},"Choose your carrier - Partner with a reliable delivery provider like Evri to ensure fast and secure shipping.",[290],{"start":46,"end":291,"type":113},19,{"type":34,"text":293,"spans":294,"direction":37},"For more information about your Amazon FBM options, see our business page.",[],{"link_type":79},"card$dceb86cf-2922-4fe4-87f5-3739ac421772",{"variation":54,"version":26,"items":298,"primary":299,"id":318,"slice_type":81,"slice_label":30},[],{"CardImage":300,"CardAvatar":66,"CardTitle":306,"CardText":307,"ButtonText":314,"ButtonUrl":315,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":301,"alt":302,"copyright":30,"url":303,"id":304,"edit":305},{"width":60,"height":61},"Business owner sat at a desk in their home office using their laptop to book multiple parcels","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"Amazon integrations",[308,311],{"type":34,"text":309,"spans":310,"direction":37},"You can also ship orders directly using Evri.com. Why not check out our easy tool to make sending Amazon parcels even faster? ",[],{"type":34,"text":312,"spans":313,"direction":37},"You can book multiple orders at once when you connect your Amazon account with Evri. Simply import your customer orders in one go and set your parcel defaults to make sending even faster in future.",[],"Find out more",{"link_type":109,"key":316,"url":317},"333ab116-d64e-4068-8e73-924cc4776e75","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Famazon-integration","card$cb9d5d90-67ae-4b24-ab96-565af0836a59",{"variation":54,"version":26,"items":320,"primary":321,"id":330,"slice_type":331,"slice_label":30},[],{"heading":322,"description":323,"image":324},"TRUSTED by our customers","We handle over 700 million parcels every year. Trusted by leading retail brands like Hello Fresh, John Lewis, Wayfair, Next and more - we've earned more 5-star Trustpilot ratings than any other UK carrier. Check out what our customers say about their experience below or see our Trustpilot reviews for more information.",{"dimensions":325,"alt":326,"copyright":30,"url":327,"id":328,"edit":329},{"width":60,"height":61},"A family of four pose smiling in front of their front door holding two parcels. The family consists of a father, mother and two daughters.","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7201.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"trust_pilot$b838a6de-0b80-4df9-b542-9a105dc36909","trust_pilot",{"variation":54,"version":26,"items":333,"primary":334,"id":340,"slice_type":341,"slice_label":30},[],{"SectionHeader":335,"SectionText":336},"How much does it cost to sell on Amazon in 2025?",[337],{"type":34,"text":338,"spans":339,"direction":37},"Understanding the costs involved in selling on Amazon is crucial for managing your business effectively. Here’s a breakdown of the main fees,* with shipping covered by FBM:",[],"section_component$1eb6928f-6baf-466d-83b2-d19e9d568905","section_component",{"variation":343,"version":26,"items":344,"primary":345,"id":370,"slice_type":81,"slice_label":30},"cardNoImageWithCta",[],{"CardAvatar":66,"CardTitle":346,"CardText":347,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":369,"IsEco":21},"Amazon selling fees",[348,353,356,359,364],{"type":34,"text":349,"spans":350,"direction":37},"Subscription fees",[351],{"start":46,"end":352,"type":113},17,{"type":95,"text":354,"spans":355,"direction":37},"Individual Plan: £0.75 per item sold",[],{"type":95,"text":357,"spans":358,"direction":37},"Professional Plan: £25 per month",[],{"type":34,"text":360,"spans":361,"direction":37},"Referral fees\nA percentage of the total sales price, most range from 8% to 15%, depending on the product category",[362],{"start":46,"end":363,"type":113},13,{"type":34,"text":365,"spans":366,"direction":37},"Closing fees\nApplicable to media products such as books, music, videos, and DVDs. The fee is £0.50 per item",[367],{"start":46,"end":368,"type":113},12,{"link_type":79},"card$a02b2d88-e46a-49a3-983f-fc698621590b",{"variation":343,"version":26,"items":372,"primary":373,"id":391,"slice_type":81,"slice_label":30},[],{"CardAvatar":66,"CardTitle":374,"CardText":375,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":390,"IsEco":21},"Additional costs",[376,381,386],{"type":34,"text":377,"spans":378,"direction":37},"Advertising fees\nPay-per-click (PPC) campaigns to boost your product visibility.",[379],{"start":46,"end":380,"type":113},16,{"type":34,"text":382,"spans":383,"direction":37},"Shipping costs\nCosts associated with delivering products to Amazon fulfilment centres or directly to customers.",[384],{"start":46,"end":385,"type":113},14,{"type":34,"text":387,"spans":388,"direction":37},"Returns processing fees\nCharges for handling customer returns.",[389],{"start":46,"end":281,"type":113},{"link_type":79},"card$00085fa5-db09-463f-9cfd-86a265772fdc",{"variation":83,"version":26,"items":393,"primary":498,"id":504,"slice_type":81,"slice_label":30},[394,412,430,457,479],{"CardImage":395,"CardTitle":401,"CardText":402},{"dimensions":396,"alt":397,"copyright":30,"url":398,"id":399,"edit":400},{"width":60,"height":61},"A customer sat on a sofa in their lounge, holding their tablet and looking at their screen.","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xs8JbqstJ9-WfG_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5477.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6Xs8JbqstJ9-WfG",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"Market research",[403,408],{"type":34,"text":404,"spans":405,"direction":37},"Identify profitable niches\nUse tools like Amazon Best Sellers and Google Trends to find high-demand products.",[406],{"start":46,"end":407,"type":113},26,{"type":34,"text":409,"spans":410,"direction":37},"Analyse competitors\nStudy successful sellers in your niche to understand their strategies.",[411],{"start":46,"end":291,"type":113},{"CardImage":413,"CardTitle":419,"CardText":420},{"dimensions":414,"alt":415,"copyright":30,"url":416,"id":417,"edit":418},{"width":60,"height":61},"A close-up of a customer's hands as they are crouched on the floor, placing folded items a cardboard box.","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XsC5bqstJ9-WeQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5239.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6XsC5bqstJ9-WeQ",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"Sourcing products",[421,426],{"type":34,"text":422,"spans":423,"direction":37},"Choose reliable suppliers\nUse platforms like Alibaba or local wholesalers to find quality products.",[424],{"start":46,"end":425,"type":113},25,{"type":34,"text":427,"spans":428,"direction":37},"Consider private labelling\nCreate your own brand by customising generic products.",[429],{"start":46,"end":407,"type":113},{"CardImage":431,"CardTitle":437,"CardText":438},{"dimensions":432,"alt":433,"copyright":30,"url":434,"id":435,"edit":436},{"width":60,"height":61},"An Evri Courier leaving a stack of parcels with a neighbour due to the recipient not being in. He is taking the name of the neighbour on a blue slip to post to the recipient.","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdH5bqstJ9-inu_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8134.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zdH5bqstJ9-inu",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"Setting up your store",[439,442,446,451,454],{"type":34,"text":440,"spans":441,"direction":37},"As we’ve mentioned, here is a recap of what you need to set up your Amazon store. See our earlier section on ‘How to start selling on Amazon’ for more specific details.",[],{"type":34,"text":443,"spans":444,"direction":37},"Create a brand identity\nDesign a professional logo and choose a memorable store name.",[445],{"start":46,"end":281,"type":113},{"type":34,"text":447,"spans":448,"direction":37},"Optimise your product listings",[449],{"start":46,"end":450,"type":113},30,{"type":95,"text":452,"spans":453,"direction":37},"Use high-quality images and detailed descriptions",[],{"type":95,"text":455,"spans":456,"direction":37},"Include keywords to improve search visibility",[],{"CardImage":458,"CardTitle":464,"CardText":465},{"dimensions":459,"alt":460,"copyright":30,"url":461,"id":462,"edit":463},{"width":60,"height":61},"A courier scanning a parcel barcode using their mobile device","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDbpbqstJ9-cfN_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3670.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6pDbpbqstJ9-cfN",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"Managing your store",[466,471,475],{"type":34,"text":467,"spans":468,"direction":37},"Inventory management\nKeep track of your stock levels to avoid running out of products.",[469],{"start":46,"end":470,"type":113},20,{"type":34,"text":472,"spans":473,"direction":37},"Customer service\nRespond promptly to customer enquiries and handle returns efficiently for a positive experience.",[474],{"start":46,"end":380,"type":113},{"type":34,"text":476,"spans":477,"direction":37},"Marketing strategies\nUse Amazon’s advertising tools and social media to promote your products.",[478],{"start":46,"end":470,"type":113},{"CardImage":480,"CardTitle":486,"CardText":487},{"dimensions":481,"alt":482,"copyright":30,"url":483,"id":484,"edit":485},{"width":60,"height":61},"A side-profile view of a customer sitting on a sofa in their lounge, holding their mobile phone and looking at their screen.","how-to-sell-on-amazon.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xsw5bqstJ9-We8_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5361.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6Xsw5bqstJ9-We8",{"x":46,"y":46,"zoom":47,"background":48},"Legal and financial considerations",[488,493],{"type":34,"text":489,"spans":490,"direction":37},"Register your business\nEnsure your business complies with local regulations.",[491],{"start":46,"end":492,"type":113},22,{"type":34,"text":494,"spans":495,"direction":37},"Tax obligations\nUnderstand VAT and other taxes applicable to your sales.",[496],{"start":46,"end":497,"type":113}